B.a8S=s(["h_fourier",1,"Bu\u011fulu Pencere","The Misty Window","K\u0131\u015f sabah\u0131 pencere cam\u0131 buz gibi. Camdan d\u0131\u015far\u0131 ne kadar \u0131s\u0131 ka\xe7t\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 hesapla.","On a winter morning the window pane is ice-cold. Work out how much heat escapes through the glass."],t.G)
B.a4U=s(["h_newton",1,"S\u0131cak Tencere Kapa\u011f\u0131","Hot Pan Lid","Yemek pi\u015ferken tencere kapa\u011f\u0131 mutfa\u011f\u0131 \u0131s\u0131t\u0131yor. Kapa\u011f\u0131n havaya verdi\u011fi \u0131s\u0131y\u0131 bul.","While dinner cooks, the pan lid warms the kitchen. Find the heat it gives to the air."],t.G)
B.a5u=s(["h_sb",1,"K\u0131\u015f Sabah\u0131","Winter Morning","So\u011fuk bir odada \xfc\u015f\xfcyorsun. V\xfccudunun duvarlara \u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131mla ne kadar \u0131s\u0131 kaybetti\u011fini hesapla.","You feel cold in a chilly room. Work out how much heat your body radiates to the walls."],t.G)
B.a7X=s(["h_rcrit",2,"Kablo K\u0131l\u0131f\u0131","The Cable Sheath","Elektrik\xe7i, kabloyu kal\u0131n k\u0131l\u0131fla sarman\u0131n so\u011fumas\u0131n\u0131 bozup bozmayaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 soruyor. Kritik yar\u0131\xe7ap\u0131 bul.","The electrician asks whether a thick sheath will stop the cable cooling. Find the critical radius."],t.G)
B.a6a=s(["h_finlong",2,"Kampta Kep\xe7e","Ladle at the Camp","Kamp oca\u011f\u0131ndaki tencereye al\xfcminyum kep\xe7e unuttun. Sap\u0131ndan ne kadar \u0131s\u0131 ka\xe7\u0131yor?","You left an aluminium ladle in the pot on the camp stove. How much heat leaks out through its handle?"],t.G)
B.a6d=s(["h_lumped",2,"Bak\u0131r Bilye","The Copper Ball","At\xf6lyede s\u0131cak bak\u0131r bilyeyi so\u011fumaya b\u0131rakt\u0131n. Eline alabilmek i\xe7in ne kadar beklemen gerekir?","In the workshop you leave a hot copper ball to cool. How long until you can pick it up?"],t.G)
B.a8r=s(["h_semi",3,"Donan Borular","Frozen Pipes","K\xf6y evinin su borusu topra\u011f\u0131n alt\u0131nda. Uzun bir k\u0131\u015fta boru derinli\u011finde toprak donar m\u0131?","The village house\u2019s water pipe is underground. Does the soil freeze at pipe depth in a long winter?"],t.G)
B.a7S=s(["h_hxbal",2,"Kombi E\u015fanj\xf6r\xfc","Combi Boiler Exchanger","Kombinin plakal\u0131 e\u015fanj\xf6r\xfc kalorifer suyuyla musluk suyunu \u0131s\u0131t\u0131yor. Musluk suyu ka\xe7 dereceye \xe7\u0131kar?","The combi boiler\u2019s plate exchanger warms tap water with heating water. How hot does the tap water get?"],t.G)
B.a2M=s(["h_dittus",3,"Kalorifer Tesisat\u0131","Central Heating","Tesisat\xe7\u0131, borudaki s\u0131cak suyun \u0131s\u0131 ta\u015f\u0131n\u0131m katsay\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 soruyor. Hesapla.","The plumber asks for the convection coefficient of the hot water in the pipe. Work it out."],t.G)
B.abo=s(["h_vplate",3,"Panel Radyat\xf6r","Panel Radiator","Odadaki panel radyat\xf6r s\u0131cac\u0131k. Havaya ne kadar iyi \u0131s\u0131 verdi\u011fini (h) bul.","The room\u2019s panel radiator is toasty. Find how well (h) it passes heat to the air."],t.G)
