B.aif=new A.Z("Summary","mecSI is a learning app. Your account details (e-mail, phone) and progress are stored on your own device. Only if you use the friends feature are your name, XP, streak and friend code sent to a server for the friends list (see \u201cFriends\u201d below).")
B.ai6=new A.Z("Information you enter","The first name, last name, e-mail and optional phone number you type when creating a profile are kept only on your device, in the app\u2019s own storage. They are used only to show your name on the leaderboard and are never shared.")
B.ais=new A.Z("Progress data","Your answers, points, badges, notes and settings are also stored only on your device.")
B.ai1=new A.Z("Friends","When you open Profile \u203a Leaderboard \u203a Add friend, the app creates an identity for this phone and a fixed 8-character friend code on Google Firebase (Firestore and anonymous sign-in). The server keeps only your name, XP, streak, whether you have mecSI+, your friend code and the friend requests you send or receive; your e-mail and phone number are never sent. Only other students using the app can see this (people who know your code and your friends). Profile \u203a My account \u203a Delete my account (or Sign out) deletes your friend record, code and requests from the server. If you use \u201cReport and block\u201d on an offensive name, the reported person\u2019s name and ID are stored on the server for review.")
B.ail=new A.Z("Advertising","The Android and iPhone apps show Google AdMob ads: rewarded ads, banner ads at the bottom of pages, and full-screen ads when a quiz ends or when you come back to the app. mecSI+ members see no ads. To serve and measure ads, AdMob may process data such as your device\u2019s advertising ID, IP address and device information. Details: Google\u2019s privacy policy (policies.google.com/privacy). On iPhone the app asks once whether you allow tracking (App Tracking Transparency): if you allow it, your advertising ID may be used to show ads that match your interests; if not, only non-personalised ads are shown and we do not track you across other apps or websites. You can change this any time in iPhone Settings \u203a Privacy & Security \u203a Tracking. On Android you can reset or delete your advertising ID in the device settings. Users in Europe see Google\u2019s consent form before any ads.")
B.ai8=new A.Z("Purchases","mecSI+ is bought through Google Play or the App Store. The store handles payment; we never see or store card details. The app only knows whether the purchase was made.")
B.aj3=new A.Z("Deleting your data","Profile \u203a My account \u203a Delete my account removes your profile from the device and your friend record from the server. Uninstalling the app removes all mecSI data from the device.")
B.aiB=new A.Z("Children","mecSI is meant for university students and does not knowingly collect data from children under 13.")
B.ait=new A.Z("Changes and contact","If this policy changes, the current version is published on this page. For questions, use the developer contact address on the app store page.")
B.a9z=s([B.aif,B.ai6,B.ais,B.ai1,B.ail,B.ai8,B.aj3,B.aiB,B.ait],t.Wy)
